`ArbitrumBranchBridgeAgent` is a special type of `BranchBridgeAgent` to be deployed on the same chain as the `RootBridgeAgent`. Because of that the `_requiresEndpoint(...)` modifier has a different implementation that allows only direct calls from the `RootBridgeAgent`. 
