# Vulnerability details

## Impact
The callOutSignedAndBridgeMultiple function in the BranchBridgeAgent contract uses abi.encodePacked() with multiple dynamic arguments. 
This can lead to collision issues due to the way Solidity packs dynamic types. 
The collision can occur when the dynamic types are concatenated and the length of the first dynamic type is controlled by an attacker. 
This can lead to unexpected behaviour and potential security vulnerabilities.
